  "question": {
    "text": "A continuous function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Also,&nbsp;<math><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />Substituting,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>, we get,<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>"
  }
}